<<else>>
    You walk over and call out to the boy. He jumps upon hearing the noise, dropping his pencil and nearly dropping his notebook. He looks over at you and blushes deeply, quickly slamming his notebook down to hide his drawing. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, h- hello there! H- how are you doing today?”</span> He says in an overly formal but very nervous tone. You laugh, telling the boy he doesn’t have to be worried. You’re not going to bite him or something. 
    
        <<set _ad to [
            {
                Name: "Player",
                State: {
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
            {
                Name: "OC Mata",
                State: {
                    Outfit: "Uniform",
                    Blush: 1,
                    Mouth: "Frown",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

    <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What!?”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Your phrase seems to have confused the boy, who now looks worried as if you ARE going to bite him.</span> You sigh and try to explain that you mean him no harm in a more straightforward way. Once he understands that you are not out for his flesh, he calms down. <br>
    <br>
    You ask him what he is drawing, but he just shrugs in response, keeping his notebook hidden. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It is nothing. Just doodles that I am doing. It is not interesting!”</span> You get the feeling that is a lie but figured that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mata</span> doesn’t know you all that well yet and it would be rude to push. So, you decide to change the subject and ask him about how he is adjusting and about his hobbies outside of school. <br>
    <br>
    <span style="color:LightGreen">This seems to calm the boy down a little and the two of you enjoy your short chat. He still seems very nervous but is opening up to you slowly. You may make a friend out of him yet!</span> <br>
    <<socialChange "Mata" 3 1>>
    <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
